Package: linux-image-4.19.325-furiphone-radon
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for FuriPhone FLX1s
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the FuriPhone FLX1s device.
 .
 Note: This package only ships the kernel image and modules, you should probably
 look at the linux-bootimage-4.19.325-furiphone-radon package for a bootimage suitable
 for boot loaders.

